rage daily turnover of L&I Products for the first three months of 2026 was $4.9 billion, an increase of 11 per cent when compared with $4.4 billion for the same period last year.\n\n- There were 40 newly listed companies for the first three months of 2026, an increase of 135 per cent when compared with 17* for the same period last year.\n\n- Funds raised through IPOs# for the first three months of 2026 was $109.9 billion, an increase of 488 per cent when compared with $18.7 billion for the same period last year.\n\n- Total funds raised for the first three months of 2026 was $150.2 billion.\n\n- Derivatives Market\n\n- The average daily volume of futures and options for the first three months of 2026 was 1,828,560 contracts.\n\n- The average daily volume of Stock Options for the first three months of 2026 was 943,511 contracts.\n\n- On 27 March 2026, the volume of Hang Seng Biotech Index Futures reached a record high of 1,239 contracts.\n\n* Includes 1 listing from GEM to Main Board and 1 de-SPAC transaction\n\n# Includes fund raised by initial offering by way of subscription, sales and placing\n\nMonth-end figures\n\n Mar 2026\n\n Mar 2025\n\n End 2025\n\n No. of listed companies\n\n 2,707\n\n 2,627\n\n 2,686\n\n Total market capitalisation ($Bil.)\n\n 45,941.2\n\n 39,952.7\n\n 47,392.5\n\n No. of newly listed companies *\n\n 16\n\n 7\n\n 119\n\n No. of listed securities\n\n 17,523\n\n 15,060\n\n 16,969\n\n No. of SPAC shares\n\n -\n\n 3\n\n 0\n\n No. of equity warrants (excluding SPAC warrants)\n\n 6\n\n 3\n\n 5\n\n No. of SPAC warrants\n\n -\n\n 3\n\n 0\n\n No. of derivatives warrants\n\n 7,652\n\n 5,387\n\n 7,012\n\n No. of inline warrants\n\n -\n\n -\n\n -\n\n No. of CBBCs\n\n 5,572\n\n 5,355\n\n 5,673\n\n No. of unit trusts\n\n 253\n\n 222\n\n 240\n\n No. of debt securities\n\n 1,331\n\n 1,460\n\n 1,351\n\n* Includes the number of transfer of listings from GEM to Main Board\n\n Mar 2026\n\n Mar 2025\n\n 2025\n\n Derivatives warrants\n\n 1,201\n\n 806\n\n 10,266