ges.org\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"91f155fb7d0e79b2\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nNew WFE Data: public markets post strong growth for 2025 despite geopolitical instability\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"91f155fb7d0e79b2\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://www.world-exchanges.org/news/articles/new-wfe-data-public-markets-post-strong-growth-2025-despite-geopolitical-instability\",\n      \"description\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"ef30db8708f6bd3e\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nThe exchanges covered by WFE data are home to over 49,054 listed companies, and the market capitalization of these entities is <strong>over USD116.58tr</strong>; around USD155tr in trading annually passes through WFE members (at end-2024). The WFE is the definitive source for exchange-traded statistics and ...\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"ef30db8708f6bd3e\\\">>>\",\n      \"published\": \"February 27, 2026\",\n      \"siteName\": \"www.world-exchanges.org\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"4620926c06b5a4e6\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nWorld Federation of Exchanges\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"4620926c06b5a4e6\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://www.world-exchanges.org/\",\n      \"description\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"538dd8d708e390f3\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nWe are the World Federation of Exchanges - the global industry association for exchanges and clearing houses. ... We publish over 350 market data indicators, ranging from statistics on exchange traded products such as equities, derivatives and ETFs to granular data on IPOs, and the WFE’s Median Simple Spread liquidity indicator.\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"538dd8d708e390f3\\\">>>\",\n      \"published\": \"2 weeks ago\",\n      \"siteName\": \"www.world-exchanges.org\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTE