{"type": "message", "id": "e3a833e0", "parentId": "addb44d5", "timestamp": "2026-04-18T02:51:31.896Z", "message": {"role": "toolResult", "toolCallId": "call_63b64c2fa9c14cab8e2e15e3", "toolName": "web_search", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "{\n  \"query\": \"NASDAQ listed companies number January 2025 February March April May market capitalization domestic\",\n  \"provider\": \"brave\",\n  \"count\": 10,\n  \"tookMs\": 1009,\n  \"externalContent\": {\n    \"untrusted\": true,\n    \"source\": \"web_search\",\n    \"provider\": \"brave\",\n    \"wrapped\": true\n  },\n  \"results\": [\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"3548226a830c9c0c\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nNasdaq - Wikipedia\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"3548226a830c9c0c\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Nasdaq\",\n      \"description\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"a81f0b93ad100bc1\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nNasdaq Stock Market (formerly National Association of Securities Dealers Automated Quotations) is an American stock exchange. It is the second-largest stock exchange by market capitalization and the first fully electronic stock market. Based in Manhattan, New York City, the exchange is among ...\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"a81f0b93ad100bc1\\\">>>\",\n      \"published\": \"15 hours ago\",\n      \"siteName\": \"en.wikipedia.org\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"499653445d09a1ce\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nNYSE and Nasdaq: market cap comparison 2025| Statista\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"499653445d09a1ce\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://www.statista.com/statistics/1277195/nyse-nasdaq-comparison-market-capitalization-listed-companies/\",\n      \"description\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"06f277c800349949\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nComparison of the New York Stock Exchange (NYSE) and Nasdaq from January 2018 to January 2025, by market capitalization of listed companies (in trillion U.S. dollars) [Graph], WFE, March 10, 2025.\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"06f277c800349949\\\">>>\",\n      \"published\": \"March 3, 2026\",\n      \"siteName\": \"www.statista.com\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"cb5608716e788b8b\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nNasdaq (NDAQ) - Market capitalization\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"cb5608716e788b8b\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://companiesmarketcap.com/nasdaq/marketcap/\",\n      \"description\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"8822da9d89aab64d\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nAs of April 2026 Nasdaq has a market cap of <strong>$50.74 Billion USD</strong>. This makes Nasdaq the world&#x27;s 493th most valuable company by market cap according to our data.\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"8822da9d89aab64d\\\">>>\",\n      \"siteName\": \"companiesmarketcap.com\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"27fdc80a5c9b3254\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nNasdaq-100 - Wikipedia\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"27fdc80a5c9b3254\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Nasdaq-100\",\n      \"description\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"0455eb857d0ab90f\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nForeign companies were first admitted to the Nasdaq-100 in January 1998, but had higher standards to meet before they could be added. Those standards were relaxed in 2002, while standards for domestic firms were raised, ensuring that all companies met the same standards.\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"0455eb857d0ab90f\\\">>>\",\n      \"published\": \"7 hours ago\",\n      \"siteName\": \"en.wikipedia.org\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"10432728c6d5099c\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nNYSE and Nasdaq: listed companies compari