ue, listed companies count (~2,300-2,400), market cap, and NYSE Composite/DJIA index levels for Jan-May 2025\n4. Search for SSE Composite Index month-end levels and monthly turnover (RMB → USD conversion) for Jan-May 2025\n5. Search for SZSE Component Index month-end levels and monthly turnover for Jan-May 2025\n6. Compile all data, convert currencies where needed (RMB to USD, HKD to USD)\n7. Calculate average daily trading value where total trading value and trading days are available\n8. Assemble 25-row markdown table\n9. Write to `answer.txt`\n\n## Critical Context\n- **HKEX data found so far** (from mondovisione HKEX Monthly Market Highlights 202526):\n  - Jan 2025: mkt cap $35.4T, ADT $143.8B, 2,631 listed cos, HSI ~20,221\n  - Feb 2025: mkt cap $40.0T, ADT $204.4B, 2,632 listed cos, HSI ~22,941\n  - Mar 2025: mkt cap $39.2T, ADT $215.1B, 2,639 listed cos, HSI ~23,119\n- **HKEX Apr 2025**: mkt cap $39.0T, ADT $211.0B, 2,644 listed cos (from HKEX Monthly Highlights fetched earlier in truncated content)\n- **China listed companies** (Xinhua, end of April 2025): SSE 2,284; SZSE 2,871; total 5,420\n- **NASDAQ listed companies**: approximately 3,500+ (need monthly specifics)\n- **NYSE listed companies**: approximately 2,300+ (need monthly specifics)\n- Key URLs: `https://mondovisione.com/media-and-resources/news/hkex-monthly-market-highlights-202526/`, `https://www.hkex.com.hk/Market-Data/Statistics/Consolidated-Reports/HKEX-Monthly-Market-Highlights?sc_lang=en`, `https://ir.nasdaq.com/static-files/465d2157-c476-4546-a9f7-8d7ad0c9be77`, `https://www.ceicdata.com/en/china/shanghai-stock-exchange-market-capitalization`, `https://www.ceicdata.com/en/china/shenzhen-stock-exchange-market-capitalization`\n- Output file: `answer.txt` in workspace\n\n## Tool Failures\n- web_fetch: This operation was aborted", "firstKeptEntryId": "ee333f8e", "tokensBefore": 111531, "details": {"readFiles": [], "modifiedFiles": []}, "fromHook": true}
